## 2. Interpreted Language

Python executes code line by line, making debugging easier.

---

## 3. Object-Oriented

Supports:

* Classes
* Objects
* Inheritance
* Polymorphism

---

## 4. Portable

Python programs can run on:

* Windows
* Linux
* macOS

---

## 5. Open Source

Python is free to use and modify.

