# Python Syntax Rules

## Case Sensitive

```python
name = "Anup"
Name = "Python"
```

Both variables are different.

---

## Indentation

Correct:

```python
if True:
    print("Hello")
```

Incorrect:

```python
if True:
print("Hello")
```

Python uses indentation to define code blocks.

